# W4-SQ-01 / W5-A: SOV02's MCV chain with real orders only. The landed Rhinos
# are type-selected (T, T) and sent at the beach pillbox (72,53) whose death is
# 'Land the MCV' (a real attack click); the Africans'
# transport arrives CARRYING the SMCV, unloads with Unload mode 0 (both stay
# in the team), 'Destroy MCV Team' frees the SMCV and 'MCV ON the Beach'
# hands it to the player.
set render_every 900
set on_quit continue
set campaign sov02t.MAP Nod
until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 300 scene == game
until 60 carried(0) >= 6
until 1500 carried(0) == 0
wait 200
click unit 0:HTNK:0
key t
key t
assert selected >= 6
click cell 72 53
until 3000 units(0,SMCV) >= 1
assert units(0,SMCV) >= 1
click unit 0:SMCV
key d
until 900 buildings(0,NACNST) >= 1
assert outcome == RUNNING
end
